WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:11,980
Isn’t it a pity that Commander 9527 is gone?

2
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,500
He will come back sooner or later

3
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,820
The world of people like him is not suitable for him

4
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,940
Only suitable for the battlefield

5
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:23,780
If he goes to the battlefield

6
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,900
Then we may have an extra big killer up front.

7
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,780
As long as the knife doesn't see our necks

8
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,570
Never mind him

9
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:48,630
This is also true for those who come.

10
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:49,990
Show your teeth when entering the battle

11
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:56,260
Where to come from

12
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,350
Frequent visits to and from the imperial capital

13
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:02,660
Changgu array

14
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,060
Can I meet Wei Tongling?
